{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22185","headline":"昭国闲居 · 白居易","name":"昭国闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫闲日高起，门巷昼寂寂。\n时暑放朝参，天阴少人客。\n槐花满田地，仅绝人行迹。\n独在一牀眠，清凉风雨夕。\n勿嫌坊曲远，近即多牵役。\n勿嫌禄俸薄，厚即多忧责。\n平生尚恬旷，老大宜安适。\n何以养吾真，官闲居处僻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}